"fontSize": 11, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "First match wins! Rule 100 checked first, then 200, then *", "lineHeight": 1.25, "angle": 0, "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "seed": 74483, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 62598, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "8a2aad5263f842d7", "type": "text", "x": 2350, "y": 1040, "width": 520, "height": 120, "strokeColor": "#CBD5E1", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "text": "Think of a NACL like a security checkpoint at\nthe entrance to a building floor. It checks a\nnumbered list of rules IN ORDER.\nFirst match wins \u2014 rule 100 says ALLOW, you're in.\nRule 200 says DENY, you're blocked.\nUnlike the bodyguard (SG), the checkpoint\nDOES NOT remember you \u2014 you need a pass for\nBOTH entering AND leaving (STATELESS).", "fontSize": 11, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Think of a NACL like a security checkpoint at\nthe entrance to a building floor. It checks a\nnumbered list of rules IN ORDER.\nFirst match wins \u2014 rule 100 says ALLOW, you're in.\nRule 200 says DENY, you're blocked.\nUnlike the bodyguard (SG), the checkpoint\nDOES NOT remember you \u2014 you need a pass for\nBOTH entering AND leaving (STATELESS).", "lineHeight": 1.25, "angle": 0, "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "seed": 78243, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 94768, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "79d9251b65a44aa4", "type": "text", "x": 2950, "y": 880, "width": 300, "height": 20, "strokeColor": "#2563EB", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "text": "Key Properties:", "fontSize": 12, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Key Properties:", "lineHeight": 1.25, "angle": 